  "strings": [
    "It began long ago, when the Dark Lord Sauron\u0000",
    "crafted a Ring of Power, to enslave the world of Middle-earth.\u0000",
    "To resist his malice\u0000",
    "a last alliance of Elves and Men\u0000",
    "marched forth against his armies of Darkness.\u0000",
    "Tangado a chadad ... Leitho I philinn! (Prepare to fire … Loose arrows!)\u0000",
    "In the vales of Mordor we fought for our lives and for our freedom.\u0000",
    "Learn well the arts of war...\u0000",
    "for they hold our only hope of victory.\u0000"
  ]
